[{"text": "And I now give the floor to His", "start": 4.84, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Excellency", "start": 6.8, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "Espen", "start": 8.48, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Barth Eide,", "start": 9.88, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "Minister of Foreign Affairs of Norway.", "start": 12.64, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": ">> The old world is dying, and the new", "start": 33.28, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "world struggles to be born.", "start": 36.64, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "Now is the time of monsters.", "start": 39.56, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "President,", "start": 42.92, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "distinguished delegates,", "start": 44.08, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "these words stem from the Italian", "start": 46.16, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "philosopher Antonio Gramsci,", "start": 48.32, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "written in one of Mussolini's prison", "start": 50.76, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "cells in the 1930s.", "start": 53.0, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "The monsters he refers to", "start": 55.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "were the dark political, social, and", "start": 58.52, "duration": 6.359}, {"text": "ideological phenomena of his time.", "start": 61.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Gramsci describes a time of transition,", "start": 64.879, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "of insecurity,", "start": 67.84, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "and the collapse of hegemonies.", "start": 69.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "His worries were not unwarranted.", "start": 72.28, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "His era", "start": 75.52, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "ended with the largest catastrophe of", "start": 76.88, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "them all, the Second World War.", "start": 79.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Our United Nations was founded by", "start": 82.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "leaders who had lived through two World", "start": 85.24, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Wars,", "start": 87.8, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "a devastating economic collapse, and the", "start": 88.92, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "rise of fascism and Nazism.", "start": 91.56, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "They had experienced firsthand", "start": 95.2, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "that all nations suffer in war and", "start": 97.76, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "conflict, and when international", "start": 99.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "cooperation fails.", "start": 101.92, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "We too are living in turbulent times.", "start": 104.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Yet at the very moment when we need it", "start": 108.12, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "most,", "start": 110.44, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "our United Nations faces its most", "start": 111.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "serious challenge.", "start": 114.64, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "We see an erosion of respect for", "start": 117.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "international law,", "start": 119.32, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "a loss of confidence in the merits of", "start": 121.32, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "cooperation,", "start": 123.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "of financing, and of effectiveness.", "start": 125.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "These are symptoms of the same disease.", "start": 128.96, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "A growing belief that power matters more", "start": 132.24, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "than principle.", "start": 134.84, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "A growing temptation to seek national", "start": 136.52, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "advantage at the expense of common", "start": 138.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "rules.", "start": 140.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "But history teaches us a simple lesson.", "start": 142.68, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "When rules are undermined, instability", "start": 146.12, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "grows.", "start": 148.56, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "When cooperation weakens, instability", "start": 149.84, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "spreads.", "start": 152.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Smaller countries like my own,", "start": 153.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and in fact, the last the vast majority", "start": 156.92, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "of this assembly, are particularly", "start": 159.24, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "dependent on common international rules.", "start": 161.36, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "But we also learned that all states end", "start": 165.12, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "up suffering if unchecked violence is", "start": 167.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "unleashed.", "start": 170.2, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Today, the repercussions of ongoing wars", "start": 172.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "are felt across the globe.", "start": 174.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "I am here with one message.", "start": 177.4, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "We who honor the UN Charter", "start": 179.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "must also stand ready to make some tough", "start": 181.92, "duration": 3.319}, {"text": "calls.", "start": 184.16, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Reform is necessary.", "start": 185.239, "duration": 5.881}, {"text": "Not because the United Nations failed,", "start": 188.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "but because it matters.", "start": 191.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "President, today our United Nations", "start": 193.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "finds itself in a triple crisis.", "start": 196.0, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "It's a normative crisis, it's a", "start": 199.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "financial crisis, and an institutional", "start": 201.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "crisis.", "start": 203.56, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "First, the normative crisis.", "start": 205.48, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "The fundamental rules that protect the", "start": 208.64, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "integrity of sovereign state and", "start": 210.32, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "prohibit the use of force, except in", "start": 212.12, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "self-defense, are threatened.", "start": 214.28, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "The number of ongoing wars", "start": 217.239, "duration": 4.681}, {"text": "is alarmingly high.", "start": 219.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Most dramatically, the number of wars", "start": 221.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "between states is the highest since the", "start": 224.08, "duration": 5.159}, {"text": "United Nations was established.", "start": 226.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Yet, this was the key motive for", "start": 229.239, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "establishing this organization in the", "start": 231.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "first place. To save succeeding", "start": 233.16, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "generations from the scourge of war.", "start": 235.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "International law is not", "start": 239.04, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "charity to the weak.", "start": 241.36, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "It's a common investment in a system", "start": 243.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "that reduces risk, friction, and cost", "start": 244.8, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "for everyone, including the great", "start": 247.72, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "powers.", "start": 250.08, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "Take freedom of navigation as an", "start": 251.84, "duration": 2.84}, {"text": "example.", "start": 253.36, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "This long-standing principle enshrined", "start": 254.68, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "in our convention of the law of the sea", "start": 256.92, "duration": 4.439}, {"text": "benefits every state.", "start": 259.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The Strait of Hormuz shows us why.", "start": 261.359, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Its closure raises energy prices,", "start": 264.0, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "disrupts global supply lines, and curbs", "start": 266.48, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "growth far beyond the region itself.", "start": 269.08, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "From petrol pumps in Minneapolis to", "start": 271.96, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Oslo, from Cape Town to Mumbai.", "start": 274.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "International law is not a menu you can", "start": 276.64, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "choose from at will.", "start": 279.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "It must be upheld universally.", "start": 281.24, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "When we", "start": 284.56, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "condemn Russia's clear violation of", "start": 285.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "international law in Ukraine, it is", "start": 287.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "equally important to speak out of", "start": 290.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Israel's violations of the same rules in", "start": 292.12, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "Palestine.", "start": 294.4, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "International law is only relevant if", "start": 295.84, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "it's enforced.", "start": 298.68, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": "There is no alternative to the two-state", "start": 301.96, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "solution.", "start": 304.12, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "At this General Assembly, there's been a", "start": 305.68, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "record number of Palestine-related", "start": 307.96, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "meetings.", "start": 310.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "The support for a Palestinian state has", "start": 311.76, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "never been stronger, yet the situation", "start": 313.72, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "on the ground is more dire than ever.", "start": 315.919, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "We must act now with moral clarity", "start": 319.04, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "and ensure that the coming year becomes", "start": 321.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "a year of implementation.", "start": 323.8, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "My message is this.", "start": 327.08, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "Only if we apply international law to", "start": 328.72, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "all people, in all places, and at all", "start": 330.88, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "times, can we claim that these are", "start": 333.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "universal rules.", "start": 335.08, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "Double standards quickly translate into", "start": 337.24, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "no standards at all.", "start": 340.64, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Secondly, the UN is in a financial", "start": 343.84, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "crisis. Major contributors are", "start": 345.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "withholding or delaying payments.", "start": 348.6, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Wars and security concerns divert", "start": 351.16, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "resources away from the fulfillment of", "start": 353.28, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "our sustainable development goals.", "start": 355.84, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "And when resources are available, they", "start": 358.44, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "too often come with strict earmarking.", "start": 361.4, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "We, the donors, should earmark less and", "start": 364.76, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "allow more flexible use of resources.", "start": 367.44, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "Norway remains one of the UN's 10", "start": 371.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "largest donors.", "start": 373.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We will use our funding to support and", "start": 375.6, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "promote reform.", "start": 378.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Because we believe in investing in the", "start": 380.28, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "UN.", "start": 382.44, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "We believe that active, constructive", "start": 383.6, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "implementation of the UN 80 reforms is", "start": 385.52, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "necessary for its future.", "start": 388.28, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "This will be a key factor when we assess", "start": 390.76, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "future voluntary contributions to", "start": 393.68, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "agencies, funds, and programs.", "start": 396.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Thirdly, the UN is an in an", "start": 400.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "institutional crisis.", "start": 402.24, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "I am a strong believer in this", "start": 404.68, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 406.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "But I also recognize that over time, we", "start": 408.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "have added excessive complexity to our", "start": 410.84, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 413.6, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Too often, when we identify a new", "start": 415.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "challenge or a new idea, we create a new", "start": 417.88, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "agency, a new convention, a fund, or a", "start": 420.8, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "program to address it. With then comes", "start": 423.2, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "with secretariats, staff, resources, and", "start": 425.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "bureaucracies.", "start": 428.84, "duration": 2.96}, {"text": "And on the ground,", "start": 430.36, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "an average developing country hosts no", "start": 431.8, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "less than 23 different UN organizations.", "start": 434.24, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "In the most vulnerable states, the", "start": 438.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "number is even higher.", "start": 440.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "We also have 10 human rights treaty", "start": 442.68, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "bodies", "start": 444.919, "duration": 3.321}, {"text": "and 11 secretariats for global", "start": 446.04, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "environmental treaties.", "start": 448.24, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "I pay tribute to the dedicated and", "start": 450.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "serious staff that is representing us", "start": 453.0, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "all out there, at times in at times very", "start": 456.0, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "difficult places.", "start": 458.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "But those who care about the UN must", "start": 461.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "ask, are we improving delivery or just", "start": 462.96, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "creating more fragmentation and", "start": 466.24, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "duplication?", "start": 468.12, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "The United Nations derives its", "start": 470.12, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "legitimacy from the sovereign equality", "start": 471.88, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "of states.", "start": 474.16, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Yet many member states are struggling to", "start": 475.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "keep pace and to participate.", "start": 478.2, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "We must simplify. We must focus. We must", "start": 480.88, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "improve our capacity to deliver as one", "start": 484.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and create more impact on the ground.", "start": 486.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "We, the member states, must give", "start": 490.56, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "guidance to the Secretary General in", "start": 492.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "succeeding with the ongoing", "start": 494.28, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "reform endeavor.", "start": 496.88, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "At times, this might require a solid", "start": 498.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "doses of tough love.", "start": 500.84, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "President, the cost of war affects us", "start": 504.68, "duration": 3.239}, {"text": "all.", "start": 506.76, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "Grain and fertilizer supplies disrupted", "start": 507.919, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "by Russia's war against Ukraine", "start": 510.2, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "undermine food security far beyond", "start": 512.24, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Europe's shores.", "start": 515.12, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Russia's war against Ukraine and the", "start": 517.08, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "conflict in the Strait of Hormuz teach", "start": 519.96, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "us the same lesson.", "start": 522.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "When might succeeds over right, we all", "start": 523.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "pay the price.", "start": 526.6, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "Often, the consequence of war also come", "start": 528.839, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "home to haunt the aggressor.", "start": 531.36, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "What was described by President Putin as", "start": 534.24, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "a special military operation that would", "start": 536.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "be over in days or maybe weeks is now", "start": 538.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "well into its fifth year.", "start": 541.16, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "Likewise, there is no end in sight for", "start": 543.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "the war in the Gulf.", "start": 545.92, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Both wars reminds us", "start": 547.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "about the limitations of military power.", "start": 550.24, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Military action is never the goal in", "start": 553.56, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "itself.", "start": 555.48, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "Clausewitz described war as the", "start": 557.04, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "continuation of politics by other means.", "start": 558.839, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Well,", "start": 561.8, "duration": 2.76}, {"text": "if the war's political goals cannot be", "start": 562.76, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "achieved, war just becomes unnecessary", "start": 564.56, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "death, destruction, and loss.", "start": 567.32, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "And frankly,", "start": 569.8, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "demonstrations of weakness.", "start": 571.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "The limited success of these and other", "start": 574.4, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "ongoing wars is in in itself a strong", "start": 576.12, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "argument for prevention, mediation, and", "start": 579.04, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "peace building.", "start": 580.96, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Diplomacy can work", "start": 582.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "if we allow it to.", "start": 584.96, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "We saw a good example of this this week.", "start": 586.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "The agreement between our neighbor", "start": 590.24, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Denmark, Greenland, and the United", "start": 591.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "States serves as an example of how good", "start": 593.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "diplomacy can lead to a lasting solution", "start": 596.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "that respects the interest of all", "start": 599.64, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "parties while fully respecting their", "start": 601.08, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "sovereign rights.", "start": 603.76, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": "Colleagues, we need to continue our", "start": 606.8, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "quest to ensure that there can be no", "start": 608.68, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "impunity for committing the most grave", "start": 610.52, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "international crimes.", "start": 613.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "The International Criminal Court is one", "start": 615.8, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "of the most important expressions of", "start": 617.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "this noble quest.", "start": 619.84, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Together with so many like-minded", "start": 622.04, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "countries, we will strengthen our", "start": 624.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "resolve to defend and to further develop", "start": 626.08, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "the ICC.", "start": 629.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Norway resoundingly rejects the calls", "start": 631.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "for dismantling the International", "start": 634.76, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Criminal Court.", "start": 636.76, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "President, the triple crisis I have set", "start": 640.2, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "out here is no less than an existential", "start": 642.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "crisis for our United Nations.", "start": 644.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Yet thankfully, to counter this, we have", "start": 648.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "concrete proposals for reform on the", "start": 650.4, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "table, the UN 80 initiative.", "start": 652.72, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "The UN 80 initiative is a test of our", "start": 655.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "ability to build a stronger, more robust", "start": 657.72, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "UN.", "start": 660.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Norway supports the level of ambition", "start": 662.56, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "that the Secretary-General has set out.", "start": 665.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "We support the proposals across all work", "start": 667.4, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "streams, including structural changes.", "start": 669.8, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "The UN 80 process has already produced", "start": 673.48, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "successes.", "start": 675.64, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "The mandate resolution laid the", "start": 677.04, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "foundation for better joint decisions.", "start": 678.52, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "We all agree that we must rationalize", "start": 681.52, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "mandates, streamline reporting, and", "start": 683.32, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "organize our work to allow for broad,", "start": 686.04, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "effective participation.", "start": 688.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Norway is proud to play a role in this", "start": 690.2, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "process.", "start": 692.96, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "But we also do need structural", "start": 694.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "structural change. We need to be better", "start": 696.44, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "at delivering as one.", "start": 699.04, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Some UN organizations frankly overlap.", "start": 701.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "They should be merged in order to serve", "start": 704.36, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "our common interest.", "start": 706.96, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "But unfortunately, colleagues,", "start": 708.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "too often member states show vested", "start": 711.04, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "interests, engage themselves in turf", "start": 712.96, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "battles, and become fearful of change.", "start": 715.24, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "Let me be clear. Reform will not succeed", "start": 718.44, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "if we always keep protecting the status", "start": 721.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "quo.", "start": 723.84, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "Let us remind ourselves that we, the", "start": 725.44, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "member states, are the owners of this", "start": 727.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "organization, not the Secretariat.", "start": 729.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "With that comes responsibility.", "start": 732.44, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "The UN 80 process needs to continue", "start": 734.96, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "under the next Secretary General.", "start": 737.28, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "We need to see this initiative succeed.", "start": 739.48, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "For an organization of 193 states to", "start": 743.24, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "function, we need a strong, independent", "start": 746.56, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "Secretary General that firmly advocates", "start": 749.2, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "the principles of the UN Charter with", "start": 751.96, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "integrity and with authority.", "start": 754.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "In a time of geopolitical tension, the", "start": 756.92, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Secretary General's good offices", "start": 759.48, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "function becomes more important than", "start": 761.08, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "ever before.", "start": 763.16, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "The next Secretary General will face the", "start": 764.92, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "formidable task of helping us lead the", "start": 767.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "United Nations out of its current", "start": 770.0, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "crisis.", "start": 771.88, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "We need someone bold and transformative.", "start": 773.12, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "She must be able to build trust, to", "start": 776.24, "duration": 4.599}, {"text": "implement our decisions, lead meaningful", "start": 778.44, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "reform, and improve effectiveness.", "start": 780.839, "duration": 5.881}, {"text": "A true reform of this organization must", "start": 784.28, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "also address the composition and", "start": 786.72, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "functioning of the Security Council.", "start": 788.72, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "That is the common call of the majority", "start": 791.32, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "of this room.", "start": 793.64, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "The absence of Africa among the", "start": 795.16, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "permanent seats of the Council is but", "start": 797.2, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "one striking example.", "start": 799.12, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "While striving to improve legitimacy, we", "start": 801.96, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "must ensure that we not do not reduce", "start": 804.2, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "efficiency.", "start": 806.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "We need a Security Council that is open,", "start": 808.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "transparent, and accountable in its", "start": 810.84, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "deliberation.", "start": 813.08, "duration": 2.96}, {"text": "A Security Council that is both", "start": 814.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "legitimate and effective, measured in", "start": 816.04, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "its ability to take meaningful action.", "start": 818.76, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "President, there is no lack of", "start": 823.28, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "challenges to be tackled.", "start": 824.92, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "While wars and geopolitical tensions", "start": 827.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "dominate the agenda,", "start": 829.6, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "we must not lose sight of our most", "start": 831.52, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "important shared responsibility, which", "start": 833.76, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "is to take better care of the planet on", "start": 836.56, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "which we all depend.", "start": 839.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Climate change, biodiversity loss, and", "start": 841.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "rampant pollution threatens life,", "start": 843.84, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "property, and prosperity everywhere.", "start": 846.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "The catastrophic floods that struck the", "start": 850.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Himalayas last month is yet another", "start": 852.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "stark reminder of the growing risk", "start": 854.68, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "associated with climate change.", "start": 857.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "The good news is that reducing emissions", "start": 860.0, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and ensuring a more responsible", "start": 862.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "management of the world's natural", "start": 864.08, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "resources is possible.", "start": 865.72, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "We already have the insights and", "start": 867.92, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "technologies to make this transition", "start": 870.4, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "possible.", "start": 872.2, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "And they are increasingly competitive", "start": 873.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "from an economic perspective, as seen by", "start": 875.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the fast-falling cost falling cost of", "start": 878.44, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "renewable energy.", "start": 880.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "But we can only succeed if we cooperate.", "start": 882.8, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "We cannot put fences around our climate", "start": 885.88, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "around climate, our own biosphere, or", "start": 888.04, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "deal with the ills of our oceans on our", "start": 890.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "own.", "start": 892.48, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "President,", "start": 894.8, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "we live in an era", "start": 896.2, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "of artificial intelligence.", "start": 897.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "As the Secretary-General", "start": 900.2, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "uh said it in his speech,", "start": 902.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "the danger is not technology.", "start": 904.52, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "The The danger is technology without", "start": 908.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "accountability. I agree.", "start": 910.48, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "Colleagues, we should not panic.", "start": 913.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "But we must be determined.", "start": 917.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "There There nothing inevitable in this", "start": 919.8, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "development.", "start": 921.64, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence is developed by", "start": 923.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "humans and must remain under human", "start": 925.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "direction, oversight, and control.", "start": 927.56, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "It is becoming an integral part of our", "start": 930.72, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "infrastructure.", "start": 933.2, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "A part of almost all aspects of society", "start": 934.76, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "and economy.", "start": 937.0, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "And as we have done so many times", "start": 938.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "before, we must maximize the positive", "start": 939.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "benefits of emerging technologies while", "start": 942.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "curbing its darker potentials.", "start": 944.92, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "This week, Finland and Norway are", "start": 948.08, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "appealing to businesses, governments,", "start": 950.72, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "and the UN alike to cooperate for", "start": 952.52, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "responsible management of the", "start": 954.92, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "opportunities and the risks of", "start": 956.92, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "artificial intelligence.", "start": 958.76, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Defense of essential human values goes", "start": 961.28, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "well beyond regulating technology.", "start": 963.84, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "For decades, we saw a growth in", "start": 966.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "democratic governance, respect for the", "start": 968.92, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "rule of law,", "start": 971.48, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "and respect for human rights.", "start": 972.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Sadly, this trend have no turn.", "start": 974.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Democratic backsliding, polarization,", "start": 977.88, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "and weakening weakening of our", "start": 980.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "democratic shields challenges many of", "start": 981.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "our past achievements.", "start": 985.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Increasing economic inequality in", "start": 987.48, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "countries exacerbate this trend.", "start": 990.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "We should take democratic backsliding", "start": 993.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "very seriously.", "start": 995.04, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "While this may be may seem to be", "start": 996.72, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "domestic concern,", "start": 998.4, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "we know that the way states behave", "start": 1000.04, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "internationally reflects from the on", "start": 1001.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "their domestic politics.", "start": 1004.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Authoritarian and exclusivist sentiments", "start": 1005.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "within member states will therefore also", "start": 1008.72, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "affect our capacity to address our", "start": 1010.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "shared concerns.", "start": 1013.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "President, the United Nations is one of", "start": 1016.36, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "humanity's greatest achievements.", "start": 1018.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Not because it created a perfect world.", "start": 1021.52, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "It did not.", "start": 1024.04, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "But because it helped spare us from a", "start": 1025.52, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "far worse fate.", "start": 1027.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "For 80 years, it has proved a space", "start": 1029.76, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "where nations can negotiate instead of", "start": 1031.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "fight, cooperate instead of confront,", "start": 1033.839, "duration": 4.681}, {"text": "and build rules instead of yielding to", "start": 1036.56, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "law rule power.", "start": 1038.52, "duration": 4.679}, {"text": "The world we know today is safer, more", "start": 1040.64, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "prosperous, and more just", "start": 1043.199, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "because the United Nations exist.", "start": 1045.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "The founders of the United Nations as", "start": 1048.16, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "had witnessed two World Wars and a", "start": 1050.76, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "global economic collapse.", "start": 1052.76, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "They knew something we must never", "start": 1055.28, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "forget.", "start": 1056.88, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "When law gives way to force, everybody", "start": 1058.4, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "loses.", "start": 1060.72, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "When cooperation collapses, everybody", "start": 1061.96, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "pays. When institutions fail, chaos", "start": 1064.12, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "follows.", "start": 1067.64, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "They did not build the United Nations", "start": 1069.2, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "because they believed mankind", "start": 1071.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "was perfect. They built it because they", "start": 1073.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "understood mankind is not.", "start": 1075.56, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "They built it because they know knew", "start": 1078.12, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "that without rules, without dialogue,", "start": 1080.08, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "without cooperation, history", "start": 1081.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "has a habit of repeating its darkest", "start": 1084.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "chapters.", "start": 1087.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "The responsibility is now ours.", "start": 1089.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Not only the Secretary General's.", "start": 1092.16, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Ours.", "start": 1094.36, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "The United Nations belong to the member", "start": 1095.72, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "states.", "start": 1097.76, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "We decide whether it succeed or fails.", "start": 1099.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "We decide whether reform advances or", "start": 1102.44, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "stalls.", "start": 1105.64, "duration": 3.4}, {"text": "The time for reports has passed.", "start": 1106.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The time for action is now.", "start": 1109.04, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "It is our turn", "start": 1112.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "to face the monsters of our time.", "start": 1113.84, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": ">> [applause]", "start": 1126.612, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": ">> I thank the Minister of Foreign Affairs", "start": 1128.72, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "of Norway.", "start": 1131.44, "duration": 2.84}]